{
  "_help": [
    "Sound effects for Sunrise Suite. Run `npm run sfx` after editing; WAVs go to assets/audio/sfx/<name>.wav.",
    "Each sound: optional \"preset\" (pickupCoin, powerUp, blipSelect, jump, hitHurt, click, synth, tone, random, laserShoot, explosion)",
    "with a \"seed\" (change the seed for a different variation), plus \"overrides\" for exact jsfxr parameters,",
    "OR a \"b58\" string copied from an sfxr.me link (see tools/sfx/LINKS.md). Optional \"volume\" 0..1.",
    "wave_type: 0 square, 1 sawtooth, 2 sine, 3 noise. p_base_freq ~ pitch (0.2717 C4, 0.3517 A4, 0.3837 C5, 0.4311 E5, 0.4703 G5, 0.5439 C6).",
    "Envelope values (attack/sustain/decay) are lengths: 0.1 ~ 0.02 s, 0.3 ~ 0.2 s, 0.5 ~ 0.57 s.",
    "Cozy rules: prefer sine (2), keep volume low, soften noise with p_lpf_freq 0.2-0.5, no harsh lasers or explosions."
  ],
  "defaults": {
    "sample_rate": 44100,
    "sample_size": 16,
    "sound_vol": 0.22,
    "overrides": {}
  },
